  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. AWS Systems Manager for SAP provides simplified operations and management of SAP applications such as SAP HANA. With this release, SAP customers and partners can automate and simplify their SAP system administration tasks such as backup/restore of SAP HANA.",
